{1001}{Re-poort too Sheef Chards or sum-tin but me no can be late.}
{1002}{Talk too sum Lay-de Me per-shun and ask her stuff 'bout Jack Da Rid-der vik-dums an' repoort bak tuh Lo-rd Da-vih-doohn.}
{1003}{Bi sum close thing-e for dat Egg Strav per-shun in Lay-de Mes's plays. Me can git it from En-ti-er-le Jess-is shop plays.} 
{1004}{I haf ta find sum e-liks-ar in da For-ist Of Ang-re-nis or sum-tin. Wat e-liks-ar meen? Me con-fused. Me need li down.}
